    "objective": "Add optional correlation IDs to the event processing package. Existing callers that omit an ID must keep exactly the current output shape. Public handle(name, value, correlation_id=None) and the Event model must accept the optional keyword. Propagate a supplied ID (including an empty string) through processing to JSON output as correlation_id and text output as a trailing \" correlation_id=ID\"; None means absent. The command-line interface must accept --correlation-id and support both JSON and text output (default text). Preserve existing calls. Add meaningful project tests and a README example for both the Python API and CLI. Run python -m pytest -q tests and report the actual results and remaining limitations.",
